Subject: [PATCH 17/33] target/arm_adi_v5: add Ampere P/N

Add ROM table part numbers for:
- Ampere Altra
- Ampere Altra Max
- AmpereOne AC03
- AmpereOne AC04
- AmpereOneM AC04_1

Change-Id: I4355da4355b7c99c9325e67e2fa66b8eeda2b840
Signed-off-by: Daniel Goehring <dgoehrin@os.amperecomputing.com>
---
 src/target/arm_adi_v5.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/target/arm_adi_v5.c b/src/target/arm_adi_v5.c
index afdc838bd..a6fe14f08 100644
--- a/src/target/arm_adi_v5.c
+++ b/src/target/arm_adi_v5.c
